        </p>
      </ContentSection>
    </ContentSection>

    <ContentGrid columns={2}>
      <r-cell>
        <ContentSection id="exhibits" title="Exhibits & museum history" headingLevel="h2">
          <p>
            Come hear the switches work and meet the tools that carried calls
            beyond the central office. The big switches stay put; smaller
            displays change as volunteers repair, rearrange, and add to them.
            Our exhibit guide follows the machinery and the people who keep it
            running.
          </p>
          <ActionLink href="/seattle/exhibits.html" prominence="feature">
            Explore the Seattle exhibits
          </ActionLink>
        </ContentSection>
      </r-cell>
      <r-cell>
        <ContentSection id="library" title="Seattle reference library" headingLevel="h2">
          <p>
            Old machines come with manuals, diagrams, and questions. Our
            reference library helps volunteers and researchers trace how the
            equipment works and where it came from.
          </p>
          <ActionLink href="/seattle/library.html" prominence="feature">
            Learn about the Seattle library
          </ActionLink>
        </ContentSection>
      </r-cell>
    </ContentGrid>

    <SisterMuseumsCallout>
      <p>
        Interested in more regional history? Check the Georgetown Steam Plant
        and Museum of Flight for current programs and holiday hours.
      </p>
    </SisterMuseumsCallout>
  </PageBody>
</BaseLayout>
